  "description_text": "Carry your essentials in style with our MagSafe Leather Card Holder, designed for a seamless snap-on experience. Crafted with premium PU leather, this sleek wallet attaches magnetically to your iPhone, letting you carry your cards and cash effortlessly. 🧲 Key Features: – MagSafe Compatible: Strong magnets ensure secure attachment to your iPhone. – Premium Leather Finish: Smooth, durable, and elegant look. – Slim & Lightweight: Adds functionality without bulk. – Secure Card Slot: Holds 1–2 cards safely with easy access. – Perfect Fit: Works with all MagSafe-enabled iPhones and cases. 🎨 Color: Vibrant Orange (Available in multiple colors) 📱 Compatible With: iPhone 12/13/14/15/16 Series (MagSafe Enabled)",
  "description_html": "<p>Carry your essentials in style with our MagSafe Leather Card Holder, designed for a seamless snap-on experience. Crafted with premium PU leather, this sleek wallet attaches magnetically to your iPhone, letting you carry your cards and cash effortlessly.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>🧲 Key Features:</p>\n<p>– MagSafe Compatible: Strong magnets ensure secure attachment to your iPhone.</p>\n<p>– Premium Leather Finish: Smooth, durable, and elegant look.</p>\n<p>– Slim &amp; Lightweight: Adds functionality without bulk.</p>\n<p>– Secure Card Slot: Holds 1–2 cards safely with easy access.</p>\n<p>– Perfect Fit: Works with all MagSafe-enabled iPhones and cases.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>🎨 Color: Vibrant Orange (Available in multiple colors)</p>\n<p>📱 Compatible With: iPhone 12/13/14/15/16 Series (MagSafe Enabled)</p>"
